+// yet extracted" state, which `hir_literal_count` answers as 0 -- and reading its first entry with
+// `hir_literal` stops `OutOfBounds` (94): there is no entry to answer, and no default a reader could take
+// for "no first-byte set".
+mod:hir_literal_not_extracted;
